About the stores
----------------
This project has no relation to Valve, GOG, CD PROJEKT or Epic Games. The
connectors only read, they operate with the credentials of the user and on the
machine of the user, and they give the data of no store to other persons.

The project also has no relation to IsThereAnyDeal. The prices come from its
public API with documentation, with the key of the user, from the machine of the
user and only for the games of their wishlist. No code of theirs has been taken:
there is none to take, because the API has documentation and no reference
implementation was necessary.
